{"id":"motiv","lemma":"мотив","pos":"noun","rank":1606,"glosses":["tune","motive, motif","motive, cause, reason (that which incites to action)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B2.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B2.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"мотива","plural":"мотивы"},"examples":[{"text":"Я знаю мотив, но не знаю слов.","en":"I know the tune, but I don't know the words.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"but"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"Я не могу вспомнить мотив той песни.","en":"I can't remember the tune of that song.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to remember"},null,{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"canto","l":"песнь"}]},{"text":"Наши мотивы чисты.","en":"Our motives are pure.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,null]},{"text":"Какой там мотив у этой песни?","en":"How does the song go?","words":[{"g":"what, what one"},{"g":"there"},null,{"g":"at / by"},null,{"g":"canto","l":"песнь"}]},{"text":"Том объяснил мотивы своего решения.","en":"Tom explained the reasons for his decision.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to explain","l":"объяснить"},null,{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"decision","l":"решение"}]}]}